  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4874,
      "text": "and tell them that the water is to be shared between them[10]; each should take its drink in turn.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4875,
      "text": "But they called their companion[11], and he undertook the task[12] and hamstrung her.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4876,
      "text": "Then how [terrible] My punishment and My warnings were!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4877,
      "text": "We sent against them a single blast, leaving them like trampled hedge-building twigs[13].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4878,
      "text": "We have certainly made the Qur’an easy to understand and remember; is there anyone to take heed?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4879,
      "text": "The people of Lot rejected the warnings.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4880,
      "text": "We sent against them a storm of pebbles, except the family of Lot whom We saved before dawn,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4881,
      "text": "as a blessing from Us. Thus do We reward those who give thanks.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4882,
      "text": "He had already warned them of Our punishing assault, but they doubted the warnings.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4883,
      "text": "They even demanded that he let them have their way with his angel-guests[14], so We blinded their eyes, [saying], “Taste My punishment and My warnings!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4884,
      "text": "By the early morning a lasting torment overtook them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4885,
      "text": "Taste My punishment and My warnings!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4886,
      "text": "We have certainly made the Qur’an easy to understand and remember; is there anyone to take heed?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 464,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4887,
      "text": "Indeed, warnings came to the people of Pharaoh.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 465,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4888,
      "text": "But they rejected all of Our signs, so We seized them with the grip of the All-Mighty, Most Powerful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 465,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4889,
      "text": "Are your disbelievers [O Makkans] superior to those[15] or have you been granted immunity in divine Scriptures?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 465,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4890,
      "text": "Or do they say, “We are a united front, bound to prevail.”?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 465,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4891,
      "text": "Soon their united front will be defeated, and they will flee[16].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 465,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4892,
      "text": "But the Hour is their appointed time, and the Hour is more catastrophic and more bitter.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 465,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4893,
      "text": "Indeed, the wicked are in error and blazes[17].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 465,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4894,
      "text": "On the Day when they will be dragged into the Fire on their faces, [they will be told], “Taste the agony of Hell[18]!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 530,
      "ruku": 465,
      "hizbQuarter": 212,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4895,
      "text": "We have surely created everything in a determined measure[19].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
